TOOLS (an MCP tools/list, one tool per line; call exactly one per turn)
{"name":"calendar_list_events","description":"List the events on Bob's calendars (work, personal, family) that overlap a time range, as the calendar API returns them, times in Bob's zone. At most 31 days per call.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"from":{"type":"string","description":"Start of the range: an ISO datetime, or a date (YYYY-MM-DD) for the start of that day in Bob's zone."},"to":{"type":"string","description":"End of the range: an ISO datetime, or a date (YYYY-MM-DD) for the end of that day."}},"required":["from","to"]}}
